OL,3,GNEWSASocial media helping new poets
OL,4,Abypass 'establishment gatekeepers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoet Ian McMillan says social media is
OL,7,Fhelping the next generation of poets to
OL,8,Fbreakthrough the "gatekeepers" of the
OL,9,F"poetry establishment".
OL,11,FThe 70-year-old will be appearing at
OL,12,FIlkley Literature Festival, alongside
OL,13,Fauthors such as Jacqueline Wilson and
OL,14,FKate Atkinson, swimmer Mark Foster and
OL,15,Ftennis coach Judy Murray.
OL,17,FMcMillan, who publishes a Haiku on
OL,18,FBlueSky every day, says he finds social
OL,19,Fmedia platforms to be "liberating" for
OL,20,Fthose who want to publish new work.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
