OL,3,GNEWSASocial media helping new poets
OL,4,Abypass 'establishment gatekeepers'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think Instagram poetry is fantastic.
OL,7,FIt's really liberated people who might
OL,8,Fhave felt a bit nervous about the
OL,9,Fpoetry establishment," he says.
